\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Japan \highlight\uc2  finmin Nukaga: No comment on  \highlight22\uc2 FX intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 186 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 14 April 2008\par 06:12\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, April 14 (Reuters) - Japanese Finance Minister Fukushiro Nukaga declined to comment on the possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on Monday, noting that repeating the same \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  message agreed by Group of Seven finance chiefs would help prevent any preconceptions from arising.\par \par \uc2 In their post-meeting statement, G7 finance ministers and \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  governors on Friday abandoned their long-standing language on \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  and expressed concern that sharp \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  moves could undermine economic and financial stability.\par \par \uc2 Asked his view on \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  and its effectiveness if \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  were to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to buy dollars for yen, Nukaga said: "As we wrote in the G7 communique, we share the view that a strong and stable international financial system is in our interest and we are concerned about sharp fluctuations in major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 ."\par \par \uc2 "By repeating this view, we can keep any preconceptions from arising and avoid any unexpected situations, so I would like to refrain from commenting on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," he told a parliamentary committee. (Reporting by Yoko Nishikawa; Editing by Chris Gallagher)\par \par \uc2 JAPAN-ECONOMY/NUKAGA|LANGEN|ABX|BNX|FUN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080414e44e0005q\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
