\par\par \b \uc2 ANALYSIS-Japan unlikely to step in way of dollar's slide   \b0\par\par\uc2 By Masayuki Kitano   \par \uc2 772 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 10 M\u228\'00\'E4rz 2008\par 13:16\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 2008 Reuters Limited   \par \par \uc2 TOKYO, March 10 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sell the yen despite its jump to eight-year peaks against the dollar as such action could raise hackles among Group of Seven countries.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar's drop has fuelled speculation about the potential for yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by Japanese authorities, who have a long history of aggressively fighting \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  strength to shield Japanese exporters from any damage.   \par \par \uc2 As the dollar falls below levels where the Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  has \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in years past, analysts are becoming more convinced that \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  is unlikely to stand in the way even if the dollar were to slide below the psychologically key 100 yen for the first time in more than 12 years.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  would have a hard time justifying \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  at a time when the Group of Seven nations have been calling on China to allow greater exchange rate flexibility.   \par \par \uc2 Japan's economy has pulled out of its decade-long bout of economic stagnation and deflation, which served as part of the justification for the massive \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in 2003 and 2004 when the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  spent 35 trillion yen ($342 billion) in just 15 months, mostly buying dollars.   \par \par \uc2 At the same time, the yen's surge has come as the dollar has suffered a broad-based slide to record lows against a basket of major \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Against other \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , the yen has not strengthened so much.   \par \par \uc2 "I think there is virtually no possibility of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 ," said Tohru Sasaki, chief \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  strategist for  \uc2 JP Morgan Chase Bank\uc2  in Tokyo.   \par \par \uc2 Sasaki said the dollar could fall to as low as 98 yen by the end of March.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar fell to around 101.40 yen <JPY=> on Friday, the lowest since January 2000, as data showing a surprise decline in U.S. payrolls in February heightened fears the U.S. economy had slipped into recession and triggered a deeper dollar decline.   \par \par \uc2 The Bank of \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which conducts \b \highlight22\uc2 currency intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  on behalf of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2 , has stayed out of the market since March 2004 when it sold yen to buy dollars when the dollar traded roughly between 112 yen and 103 yen.   \par \par \uc2 The yen's rise against the dollar has touched a nerve in some quarters, with  \uc2 Toyota Motor Corp\uc2  President Katsuaki Watanabe saying on Friday the yen has strengthened too much.   \par \par \uc2 But some Japanese officials have even noted the benefits of a stronger \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  with oil prices at record peaks above $100 a barrel <CLc1>.   \par \par \uc2 "A strong yen could somewhat be a disadvantage for exporters, but it will improve the terms of trade," said BOJ Governor Toshihiko Fukui last week after the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's policy meeting.   \par \par \uc2 LESS INCENTIVE   \par \par \uc2 The head of Japan's most powerful business lobby said on Monday the group would not seek government \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market to stem the yen's rise against the dollar as long as it stays around present levels.   \par \par \uc2 Fujio Mitarai, chairman of the Japan Business Federation known as Keidanren, told a news conference that exporters should be able to cope with a dollar/yen rate around 105 yen.   \par \par \uc2 Japanese Finance Vice-Minister Hiroki Tsuda declined to comment on Monday on whether \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  will \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market but said the ministry was watching the impact of the yen's rise on corporate earnings.   \par \par \uc2 The fact that the yen has not strengthened as much against \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  other than the dollar may make it hard for Japanese authorities to justify yen-selling \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , analysts said.   \par \par \uc2 "The yen may be strong against the dollar but it is not strong against the euro," said Tomoko Fujii, head of economics and strategy for Japan at  \uc2 Bank of America.\par \par \uc2 "Even if the dollar were to fall below 100 yen, I do not think we will see any \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  unless the moves are very rapid and lead to disorder in financial markets," Fujii said.   \par \par \uc2 The dollar, which stood at around 101.90 yen on Monday, has fallen around 18 percent from 4-1/2 year highs above 124 yen struck last June.   \par \par \uc2 But the euro has not fallen as much against the yen, and stood at around 156.70 yen <EURJPY=R> on Monday, down 7 percent from a record high just above 169 yen hit last July.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Japan\b0 \highlight\uc2  may also have less reason to \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  compared to years past, given an improvement in the country's economy.   \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 JAPAN\b0 \highlight\uc2 -\b \highlight22\uc2 INTERVENTION\b0 \highlight\uc2 / (ANALYSIS)|LANGEN|ABN|C|D|E|M|O|U|MTL|GRO|SOF|OIL|NAT|J|ABX|BNX|FUN   \par \par \uc2 Dokument LBA0000020080313e43a000zc\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
